      "summaries": {
        "en": "Dive-into-LLMs is a hands-on educational project that helps developers practically understand large language models through interactive Jupyter Notebook tutorials. It demystifies LLM concepts by breaking them into executable code examples, teaching core techniques like attention mechanisms and fine-tuning through direct implementation. Developers can use these notebooks to experiment with model architectures, adapt them for specific tasks, or build foundational knowledge for creating custom AI applications.",
        "zh": "《动手学大模型》是一个通过Jupyter Notebook教程帮助开发者实践掌握大模型技术的开源教育项目。它将复杂的LLM概念分解为可执行的代码示例，通过直接实现注意力机制、微调等核心技术来揭示模型工作原理。开发者可以运行这些交互式教程来理解模型架构，将其应用于特定任务，或作为构建自定义AI应用的知识基础，特别适合希望从理论转向实践的机器学习爱好者。",
        "es": "Dive-into-LLMs is a hands-on educational project that helps developers practically understand large language models through interactive Jupyter Notebook tutorials. It demystifies LLM concepts by breaking them into executable code examples, teaching core techniques like attention mechanisms and fine-tuning through direct implementation. Developers can use these notebooks to experiment with model architectures, adapt them for specific tasks, or build foundational knowledge for creating custom AI applications.",
