          "what": "Dive-into-LLMs is a hands-on educational project that helps developers practically understand large language models through interactive Jupyter Notebook tutorials. It demystifies LLM concepts by breaking them into executable code examples, teaching core techniques like attention mechanisms and fine-tuning through direct implementation. Developers can use these notebooks to experiment with model architectures, adapt them for specific tasks, or build foundational knowledge for creating custom AI applications.",
