      "summaries": {
        "en": "Magika is an AI-powered file type detection tool that solves the critical problem of accurately identifying file formats when traditional methods like file extensions or magic bytes fail. It uses a custom deep learning model trained on millions of files to analyze content patterns, achieving high accuracy even with ambiguous or maliciously disguised files. Developers can integrate it via Python or command-line tools to enhance security scanners, data processing pipelines, or forensic tools, enabling reliable format detection in complex real-world scenarios.",
        "zh": "Magika 是一款基于人工智能的文件类型检测工具，解决了传统方法（如文件扩展名或魔数字节）在识别文件格式时经常失效的关键问题。它通过定制化的深度学习模型分析数百万文件的内容模式，即使面对模糊或恶意伪装的文件也能实现高精度识别。开发者可通过Python或命令行工具将其集成到安全扫描器、数据处理流程或取证工具中，为复杂场景下的可靠格式检测提供技术支持，特别适用于需要处理未知或可疑文件的应用程序。",
        "es": "Magika is an AI-powered file type detection tool that solves the critical problem of accurately identifying file formats when traditional methods like file extensions or magic bytes fail. It uses a custom deep learning model trained on millions of files to analyze content patterns, achieving high accuracy even with ambiguous or maliciously disguised files. Developers can integrate it via Python or command-line tools to enhance security scanners, data processing pipelines, or forensic tools, enabling reliable format detection in complex real-world scenarios.",
