      "summaries": {
        "en": "Claude-Code-Game-Studios transforms Claude Code into a structured game development studio by organizing 49 specialized AI agents into a hierarchical coordination system that mirrors real-world studio workflows. The project's key insight is using role-based agent specialization with 72 distinct skills to manage complex creative tasks through distributed responsibility rather than relying on a single monolithic AI. Developers can implement this framework to automate specific game development pipelines in engines like Unity or Godot, experimenting with how AI agents handle interdependent creative and technical challenges in a controlled environment.",
        "zh": "Claude-Code-Game-Studios 将 Claude Code 转化为一个结构化的游戏开发工作室，通过 49 个专业化的 AI 智能体按照真实工作室的层级进行协调工作。该项目采用角色分工机制，让 72 种不同的工作技能分布在多个智能体中，通过分布式责任管理复杂的创意任务，而非依赖单一的大型模型。开发者可以基于此框架在 Unity 或 Godot 等引擎中自动化特定的开发流程，探索 AI 智能体如何在受控环境中处理相互依赖的创意与技术挑战，从而优化自己的游戏制作管线。",
        "es": "Claude-Code-Game-Studios transforms Claude Code into a structured game development studio by organizing 49 specialized AI agents into a hierarchical coordination system that mirrors real-world studio workflows. The project's key insight is using role-based agent specialization with 72 distinct skills to manage complex creative tasks through distributed responsibility rather than relying on a single monolithic AI. Developers can implement this framework to automate specific game development pipelines in engines like Unity or Godot, experimenting with how AI agents handle interdependent creative and technical challenges in a controlled environment.",
